        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Ammonium chloride from chlorosilane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Ammonium chloride from chlorosilane, at plant
The multioutput-process "Chlorosilane amination" delivers the co-products ammonium chloride and hexamethyldisilazane. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: 75d57b1e-3682-3e43-92d7-13a96d37eb27
Chlorosilane amination including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world..
Technology: Amination of chlorosilane
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_75d57b1e-3682-3e43-92d7-13a96d37eb27.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
